          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara menulis pernyataan kondisional yang menangani kondisi tertentu seperti UI aplikasi di bawah ini.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    let time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    let image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    let greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat menggerakkan slider, halaman web ini menggunakan pernyataan kondisional untuk menampilkan salam yang berbeda jika waktunya kurang dari pukul 7, 12, 17, dan 21.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    let time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    let image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    let greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan menggunakan pernyataan if dan else, kita bisa menulis program yang menampilkan satu sapaan jika <code>hour &lt; 12</code> bernilai <code>true</code> dan sapaan lain jika nilainya <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>hour</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&lt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk kondisi yang lebih spesifik, seperti jika <code>hour</code> tidak kurang dari <code>12</code> tetapi kurang dari <code>17</code>, kita bisa menulis kode <code>else if hour &lt; 17</code> sebagai gantinya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &gt; 23\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>if</code>, dan terakhir <code>hour &lt; 17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menyebutnya <strong>pernyataan else if</strong>. Pernyataan ini menjalankan blok kodenya jika kondisi sebelumnya bernilai <code>false</code> dan <code>hour &lt; 17</code> bernilai <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>hour</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&lt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "else statement",
            "id": 126795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat membuat kode pernyataan <code>else</code> agar menjalankan blok kodenya ketika kondisi <code>if</code> dan <code>else if</code> bernilai <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"130\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 21\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we'd like",
            "id": 126796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selama diletakkan sebelum pernyataan <code>else</code>, kita bisa menambahkan sebanyak mungkin pernyataan <code>else if</code> yang kita inginkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"110\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>if</code>, lalu <code>else</code>, <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
