            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan pesan di console ketika <code>age</code> lebih besar dari <code>12</code> tetapi kurang dari <code>17</code> dengan menulis pernyataan <code>else if</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Where are your parents?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're too young to take this ride.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"130\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to take this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>if</code>, lalu <code>age &lt; 17</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
